        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXovDnHjDrjA1pTrHavQede-JCZOACrdE4gSX-uijlYp-diRS0=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "9 months ago",
        "text": "Paul inspected 3 homes for me, the first was a pre-sale inspection of the home I recently sold that I used to both fix what needed to be repaired and included in my listing. More recently he inspected two more homes for me, one of which I purchased. Very knowledgeable and such a down to earth person. I could not have been happier with the service he provided. Very highly recommended.",
        "time": 1745707606,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Bret MacDonald",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/106975451045389999982/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVO-jmefpI8AWKMlDDyIVELAc_TddNLH7LTabNQd1mjJtVZwRo=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "10 months ago",
        "text": "I could not have been happier with my inspection. Peter brought a depth of knowledge from his decades of experience in the industry that gave us ease of mind in purchasing our new home. I have already recommended Pro Inspexx to a friend, and they received the same level of service and expertise. I will gladly recommend Pro Inspexx in the future. Thanks again! I am a very satisfied customer!",
        "time": 1742942452,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Thomas Beaucher",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/104886722398987393634/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKLTORErvBoAa89dTmrT-LoJMo3cq5U2i7hHRqV2gxZ4AMgyw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "9 months ago",
        "text": "Peter was really great to work with. Friendly, knowledgeable, helpful, communicative, punctual. Really everything you could want in an inspection. He is also patient and will explain this to you on great detail and genuinely seems happy to do so. Also, just a really pleasant person to talk to!",
        "time": 1745429868,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Mitch Spour",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/107983587319471227566/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVrPNff_J9vNhnQ5fPGdNw_qCBqMBUAgGHDyYYhkgUZ9u_3XpRh=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 years ago",
        "text": "We had Drew Pelletier inspect a home my clients were buying this week and he was amazing. Fast, efficient and amazing inspection. He was able to teach us about the house my clients were purchasing and everyone walked away better off after his inspection. 10/10 would recommend to others looking for a home inspector.",
        "time": 1692368952,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Jacques Desmarais",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/100015606096306613675/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocL1aCd9cdyd16pMtnJrTTZS4jEtDXdddx7MXPCX6CWnaf70TQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "6 years ago",
        "text": "Peter has decades of experience and if you follow him as he does the inspection, he will readily answer any questions or concerns you may have. He has a keen eye for the smallest details, and is very efficient in his investigation. He was punctual, courteous, professional, and friendly. He provided the report within a couple of days only, and the report covered everything he had mentioned, plus some. All in all, just a great and very professional service.",
